  <item>
    <title>潘玮柏主动发出自己“发胖照片”，一个男歌星可以多大程度允许自己被调侃？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b9e82d33591c27be833853</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b9e82d33591c27be833853</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Aug 2024 10:47:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>潘帅这么多年，不仅仅是外型帅了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：海绵AI音乐</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrp6p0cU-xD1Q-G-fDRPySfrADs1.m4a" length="17154422" type="audio/mp4"/>
